  "description": "Enclave AI is a local AI assistant that runs entirely on your iPhone. Try hundreds of open-source models and chat offline — no account, no cloud, no data collection. Your conversations never leave your device.\n\nUnlike cloud-based AI apps, Enclave processes everything locally using your device's hardware. No internet connection needed. No servers reading your chats. Just you and your AI, completely private.\n\nRun Popular AI Models On-Device:\n- Meta Llama\n- DeepSeek\n- Google Gemma\n- Qwen by Alibaba\n- Microsoft Phi\n- Mistral\n- SmolLM, and more\n\nDownload the models you want and switch between them freely.\n\nOptional Cloud AI with Pro:\nSubscribe to Pro for access to the latest cloud models from Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, xAI, and more. No API keys to manage — just pick a model and start chatting. Cloud conversations are not stored on our servers.\n\nVoice Chat:\nHave natural voice conversations with your AI assistant. Speech recognition and text-to-speech run on-device using Apple's built-in speech technology. Works fully offline with local models.\n\nChat with Documents:\nAttach PDFs, text files, images, and source code to your conversations. Ask questions, get summaries, and extract key information — all processed locally on your device.\n\nCustom Assistants:\nCreate personalized AI assistants with custom instructions for any task — writing, coding, brainstorming, grammar, planning, translation, and more. Each keeps its own conversation history.\n\nWeb Search:\nGet answers grounded in live web results when using cloud models. Enclave connects your AI to current information when you need it.\n\nSiri and Shortcuts:\nIntegrate Enclave into your daily workflows with Apple Shortcuts. Ask questions, choose your model, and get instant answers — hands-free with Siri.\n\nMore to Love:\n- Syntax-highlighted code blocks and full Markdown rendering\n- Reasoning display for thinking models like DeepSeek R1\n- Fine-tune responses with temperature, context window, and seed controls\n- Conversation history saved locally as simple files you control\n- Optimized for iPhone with platform-tuned model libraries\n\nBuilt for Privacy:\n- No account required to use local AI\n- No tracking or telemetry on your conversations\n- All chat history stored locally on your device\n- No third-party analytics on your content\n- Anonymous by design\n\nEnclave is built by an independent developer, not a corporation. Your data is not the business model — your trust is.\n\nTerms of service: https://enclaveai.app/terms-and-conditions/\nPrivacy policy: https://enclaveai.app/privacy-policy/",
